e chat for each one.","Works with no keys. Out of the box it answers from local rules and a set of written replies. Add a free Gemini key for real answers.","Plain JavaScript. No framework, no build step for development."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mortspace/momo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"845fc9ecf8f4fce92506a2d08a2fcdeb2bc102abe0c945eae8b8be949b6f154e","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:19.664Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:07.124Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A little 3D friend for your AI chats. It dresses for whatever you ask.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mortspace/momo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"845fc9ecf8f4fce92506a2d08a2fcdeb2bc102abe0c945eae8b8be949b6f154e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mortspace/momo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:07.124Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T11:26:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mortspace/momo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T21:55:07.124Z","hash":"845fc9ecf8f4fce92506a2d08a2fcdeb2bc102abe0c945eae8b8be949b6f154e","originalBytes":5306,"storedBytes":5306,"truncated":false},"demoEvidence":{"kind":"x_link","repository":"mortspace/momo","postUrl":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2105860483420958782","url":"https://feralui.dev/momo"},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://feralui.dev/momo","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","target":"https://feralui.dev/momo","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T09:40:02.556Z"},"previewCheck":{"url":"https://feralui.dev/momo","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T09:40:02.556Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/db62aed309a065d039229554.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T09:40:02.556